    "Our community spans people from all over the world, speaking many different languages — so we use English as AppleVis's one shared language, to keep everyone reading and talking together in the same place. It looks like your device is set to %@. Want AppleVis to automatically translate posts into %@ as you browse? You can turn this off anytime in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Our community spans people from all over the world, speaking many different languages — so we use English as AppleVis's one shared language, to keep everyone reading and talking together in the same place. It looks like your device is set to %1$@. Want AppleVis to automatically translate posts into %2$@ as you browse? You can turn this off anytime in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
